# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Nice Actions menu
- With the Nice Actions data pack, its quick actions menu (the G key) gets an **Ask Merl** button. It opens Merl's own menu: **Ask a question** (a box for anything), **Server settings** and **Find a biome** (type the setting or biome), and quick actions **Nearest slime chunk**, **Nearest claim**, **Nearest waypoint hub**, **Stay with me** / **You can go now** and **Hide and seek** / **I give up**. Every button just asks /merl, so Merl answers the same way as when you type it
- Only features that are switched on get a button (read when the server starts). Switch the button off with **niceActionsMenu**
- The data pack itself stays as it is: the button is added while the server loads the menu
